Package: msi-ec-dkms
Version: 0.13-1
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GF63 Control contributors <noreply@invalid>
Depends: dkms, gcc, make, kmod
Description: MSI embedded controller driver sources for DKMS
 Pinned upstream msi-ec driver sources. Firmware compatibility is detected
 by the driver. No firmware override or raw EC writes are configured.
 Kernel headers for the running kernel are checked at configure time
 because their package name depends on the running kernel.
